 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y72K6jIwGCIQ7kNvwGw69OD&_nc_oc=AdqfEuOrt2V2Lr_f64ifWse3D2TCiTvBWDBd-vYhbf5AXbKrzm96z2n1lHnIz0hIinY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHwHf6ZpdDthHIlUm01jTnJ5cdd7qJJeMqCXzg9CM0cFw&oe=6A898581"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c71qgxvezlkQ7kNvwGOA_-D&_nc_oc=AdoHO_EPWAYSFdfMir5xSoPSIcN_EmXRYw9XUOLnXJEa5QtO5Fa_fjMmPJz0iRsE0HM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFzBy--hqfZvqKj9RIjjhyr4PJ8d1alUMMiafaC-BhL7w&oe=6A8992E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UV33x1SytsQ7kNvwFNs1yA&_nc_oc=Ado3YuXVFEAvIqQeXtnXU1mFpvo8Kj6zxjT1lzxLM8ux3dtJaqbBZsIBK8SyopeZTH0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEFMp93uTIVd9XYHBWGTTkUHpl6krnaQ2zzcrm7UUDa2A&oe=6A899CDC"}, {"fil